/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   LEVELS

   A level is the unit the player actually plays: which regions of the
   Shattered Realm it can roll for its map and environment, what walks its
   halls, what has to be killed before the ley-gate answers, and how much slag
   buys passage out. Regions above are the environment table levels draw from,
   so a new level is a data entry here rather than a change to the generator.

   Only the test delve exists so far. It deliberately rolls all five regions,
   because its job is to exercise every environment the generator can build.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
